OL,4,CWhite House removes cyber-security     
OL,5,Cchief after series of tech outages     
OL,6,GThe top cyber-security official in the 
OL,7,GUS government is leaving his post      
OL,8,Gafter a string of tech outages which   
OL,9,Ghit the National Security Agency       
OL,10,G(NSA), the US air traffic control      
OL,11,Gsystem and some banks.                 
OL,13,FSean Cairncross had been national      
OL,14,Fcyber director since August 2025.      
OL,16,FCBS, the BBC's US news partner,        
OL,17,Freported he had been fired after       
OL,18,Flosing the confidence of White House   
OL,19,Fchief of staff Stephen Miller.         
OL,22,                                   G1/9 
