OL,4,CDutch watchdog tells people not to buy 
OL,5,CAI smart glasses                       
OL,6,GThe Dutch privacy watchdog, the        
OL,7,GAutoriteit Persoonsgegevens (AP), has  
OL,8,Gtold people not to buy smart glasses,  
OL,9,Gsaying they can get things dangerously 
OL,10,Gwrong.                                 
OL,12,FIt said in its tests of six glasses    
OL,13,Favailable on the Dutch market, the     
OL,14,Fdevices advised a user on how to date  
OL,15,Fa child, misread medicine              
OL,16,Finstructions, and claimed to have      
OL,17,Fcalled an ambulance when they had not. 
OL,19,FWhile the AP is advising people not to 
OL,20,Fbuy the smart glasses, it stopped      
OL,21,Fshort of calling for them to be banned 
OL,22,Ffrom sale.                        G5/9 
