OL,4,CUK joins in GTA 6 frenzy as game       
OL,5,Cbecomes available worldwide            
OL,6,GAfter years of anticipation and        
OL,7,Gdelays, as well as controversy around  
OL,8,Gworker rights, Grand Theft Auto 6 has  
OL,9,Gcompleted its phased worldwide release 
OL,10,Gand is available to gamers everywhere, 
OL,11,Gincluding the UK.                      
OL,13,FThere has been near universal praise   
OL,14,Ffrom critics, with review aggregator   
OL,15,FMetacritic calculating its average     
OL,16,Fscore at 99 out of 100 based on 150    
OL,17,Freviews.                               
OL,22,                                   G7/9 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
